# leave-call
# The shell stops in the middle of a call (as if it had crashed). The call
# belongs to baresip and the audio service, so it carries on. Part b picks it up.
waitstate reg ok 8000
waitstate audio up 3000
run $FAR $BOB cmd dial 1001
waitstate phone incoming 5000
key speaker
waitstate phone incall 5000
waitstate audio.route speaker 2000
key mute
waitstate audio.mute 1 2000
wait 1500
quit
